			"notes": "## Compatibility Updates \n\nMod now 1.1.0 version\nNew Version Support:\nAdded support for Minecraft 1.26.1 & 1.26.1.1\n\nWhat’s New:\nFzzy Config Integration: You can now customize the indicator icon position!\nAvailable Positions: `ABOVE_CROSSHAIR, BELOW_CROSSHAIR, LEFT_OF_CROSSHAIR, RIGHT_OF_CROSSHAIR, TOP_LEFT, TOP_RIGHT, BOTTOM_LEFT, BOTTOM_RIGHT, and CUSTOM`.\nAdvanced Customization: Use CUSTOM mode to set your own X/Y coordinates (float values from -1 to 1).\nNew Settings: Added options to adjust Icon Size and icon Padding (from screen edges or crosshair).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MEGATREX4/randomblockplacement/compare/1.21...1.1.0-26.1+26.1.1"
